---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Demo from '../components/Demo.astro';
import { demoUrl } from '../config';
const faqs = [
 ['Is CLOSEFLOW AI available now?', 'CLOSEFLOW AI is in prelaunch. This page presents the proposed workflow, not a live or generally available service. Availability, scope and onboarding will be confirmed before any purchase.'],
 ['Does this demo connect to Instagram?', 'No. It is a scripted simulation that runs only in your browser. It does not read your DMs, send messages, connect accounts or create calendar bookings. Any future integration would depend on supported APIs, permissions and platform requirements.'],
 ['Who is it being designed for?', 'Independent online fitness coaches and small coaching teams serving US and UK clients who want a more structured way to handle inbound coaching enquiries.'],
 ['Will it replace my judgement as a coach?', 'The intended workflow follows your approved coaching information and leaves sensitive questions, exceptions and final fit decisions with you. It is not designed to provide medical advice or make health assessments.'],
 ['How much will it cost?', 'Pricing and package details are not final. A prelaunch demo is a conversation about your workflow, not a commitment to buy. No payment is taken on this website.'],
 ['What happens to information I enter here?', 'There are no enquiry fields, tracking tools or cookies added by this project. Demo interactions stay in your browser and are not saved. If a booking link is enabled, the scheduling provider will handle information under its own privacy policy. GitHub Pages may process hosting logs under GitHub’s policies.'],
];
---
<Layout>
 <header class="header"><div class="container header-inner"><a href="#" class="brand" aria-label="CLOSEFLOW AI home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>CLOSEFLOW<span class="brand-ai">AI</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#workflow">How it works</a><a href="#demo">Product preview</a><a href="#faq">FAQs</a></nav><a class="button button-small" href="#early-access">Request a demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></header>
 <main id="main">
 <section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> FOR ONLINE FITNESS COACHES · PRELAUNCH</p><h1>More coaching.<br />Less chasing <span class="serif">DMs.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Your next coaching client starts with a conversation. Make it a better one.</p><p class="hero-detail">An AI appointment-setting concept designed to help qualify inbound enquiries and guide the right people towards a coaching call — with your playbook at the centre.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#early-access">Request a prelaunch demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#demo"><span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Explore the product</a></div><p class="fine-print">Built for US & UK coaches. Designed around human oversight.</p></div>
 <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a proposed coaching enquiry workflow"><div class="art-grid"></div><div class="art-top"><span class="small-label">YOUR COACHING. YOUR VOICE.</span><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div><div class="message-card"><span class="avatar">JL</span><div><small>NEW ENQUIRY · FICTIONAL EXAMPLE</small><p>“I’m ready to get stronger.<br />Where do I start?”</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><b>✧</b><span></span></div><div class="flow-card"><div class="flow-card-heading"><span class="mini-mark">↗</span><b>A conversation with direction.</b></div><div class="flow-row"><span>01</span><b>Understand their goals</b><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div><div class="flow-row"><span>02</span><b>Explore coaching fit</b><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div><div class="flow-row final-row"><span>03</span><b>Offer the next step</b><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div><div class="art-bottom"><span>ILLUSTRATIVE WORKFLOW</span><span>No live automation</span></div></div>
 </section>
 <div class="audience-strip"><div class="container"><span>MADE FOR THE WAY YOU COACH</span><p>Independent coaches</p><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i><p>Online programmes</p><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i><p>Small coaching teams</p></div></div>
 <section id="workflow" class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LESS ADMIN. MORE INTENTION.</p><h2>You bring the expertise.<br />Give every enquiry a direction.</h2></div><p>Between check-ins, programming and client calls, your inbox can become another workout. Here’s the workflow we’re building towards.</p></div><div class="workflow-grid">{[
 ['01', 'Your voice, from the start.', 'Set the tone with your offer, coaching approach and approved answers. A conversation should feel like an extension of your business.', 'Your playbook →'],
 ['02', 'Context before the call.', 'Explore goals, readiness and the kind of support someone needs, using qualification questions you choose.', 'A clearer picture →'],
 ['03', 'A thoughtful next step.', 'Guide suitable enquiries towards a consultation and flag questions that need your attention. Keep the final decision with you.', 'A human handoff ↗'],
 ].map(([number,title,text,caption]) => <article class="workflow-card"><span class="step-number">{number}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><span class="card-caption">{caption}</span></article>)}</div><p class="fine-print section-note">Proposed capabilities. Final functionality and integrations are subject to development and validation.</p></section>
 <div class="container"><Demo /></div>
 <section class="principles-section"><div class="container principles-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PURPOSEFUL BY DESIGN</p><h2>Your reputation<br />is part of the brief.</h2><p>Coaching is personal. The way you handle a first conversation should reflect that.</p><a class="text-link" href="#early-access">Let’s talk about your workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="principle-list">{[
 ['01','Your offer. Your boundaries.','The intended assistant works from approved coaching information, rather than improvising promises or results.'],
 ['02','People before pressure.','A clear next step should help someone decide. No aggressive scripts, false urgency or guaranteed transformations.'],
 ['03','A coach when it matters.','Health concerns, sensitive questions and unusual requests belong with a person. Human escalation is part of the proposed design.'],
 ].map(([n,title,text]) => <article><span>{n}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
 <section id="faq" class="section container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2>Clear answers.<br />No fine-print surprises.</h2><p>Early stage. Open about it.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a]) => <details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
 <section id="early-access" class="container cta-section"><div class="cta-content"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S BUILD A BETTER FIRST CONVERSATION</p><h2>Your next chapter<br />starts in the inbox.</h2><p>See the concept. Talk through your coaching workflow.<br />Help shape what comes next.</p>{demoUrl ? <a class="button button-lime" href={demoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request a prelaunch demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> : <div class="prelaunch-notice"><b>Demo requests opening soon.</b><p>We’re preparing the first walkthroughs. In the meantime, <a href="#demo">explore the simulated product preview ↗</a>.</p></div>}<p class="cta-fine">Prelaunch · No payment required · No promise of availability</p></div><div class="cta-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</div></section>
 </main>
 <footer class="container footer"><a href="#" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>CLOSEFLOW<span class="brand-ai">AI</span></a><p>More coaching. Less chasing.</p><div><a href="#faq">Questions & privacy</a><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} CLOSEFLOW AI</span></div></footer>
</Layout>
